  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram shows an area with a magnetic field pointing upwards and an electric field pointing into the page. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>When a proton enters the field with horizontal velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> it is undeflected by the fields.</p>\n<p>What is true about the motion of an electron and the motion of an alpha particle that enter the same area at a velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Motion of electron</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Motion of alpha particle</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>A.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>deflected</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>undeflected</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>B.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>undeflected</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>deflected</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>C.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>undeflected</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>undeflected</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>D.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>deflected</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>deflected</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
